Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。我落入了基拉古的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这咒缚的强度。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唐·萨赞德的力量。为什么基拉古会…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉古)将我们打倒连灵魂的力量都夺走！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)梅拉古！多尔贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[监视器](多尔贝)你以为那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能做得到吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)做得到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.23,0:00:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我已经让唐·萨赞德在我体内
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多尔贝)什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那…那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名乃唐·萨赞德。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界的创造主。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔让唐·萨赞德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾之仆从啊，时机已到。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是成为吾之食粮成为我的力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！ 如果你是巴利安的神
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要对我们！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因为这就是你们的宿命。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了成为我复活的力量被选中的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 七皇。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们七皇！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.17,0:01:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 那 我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。 你们从一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.16,0:01:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是唐·萨赞德的饵料啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.79,0:01:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也是七皇之一！ 和我们一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经 和唐·萨赞德融为一体了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.06,0:01:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 是神～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量… 力量不断涌上来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:01:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 他真的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到了唐·萨赞德的力量…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里交给我，快逃，梅拉格！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你去把这件事告诉其他同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)其他同伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.77,0:02:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你都没发现吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特和基拉古复活之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直都是我的棋子啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.39,0:02:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过嘛，阿里特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被游马打败之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.05,0:02:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就倒戈了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和星光体正朝这边过来呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[屏幕]和叛徒阿里特
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牵着手一起哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我们还有纳修在。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但愿如此吧。呵呵呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之啊 你们几个就在这里被我吃掉吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不会让你们逃掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要想打赢现在的贝库塔只能齐心协力了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 确实如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不想被吃掉的话 就只能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:02:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你打倒这一个办法了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就只能上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(3人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)次元的裂缝。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那对面就是巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那对面…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用混战规则来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧！我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了令人期待的卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 唐·千王座！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来想坐在这上面 悠哉地陪你玩玩{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那样 未免太失礼了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把 唐·千王座装备到自己身上～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底想干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:05:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种感觉是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 手牌中的暗影幽灵２只\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 在手牌中有２张
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同卡牌的情况下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以两只都特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤 暗影·鬼火·妖灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 在被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的怪兽和
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以变成和它相同的等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把这家伙变成和幽灵一样的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级２！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把２只等级２的暗影幽灵和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}幽灵意志之愿用来叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.96！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自漆黑黑暗的使者，黑雾！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，黑雾。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我看看你真正的样子～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.33,0:07:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是第一次见到这家伙吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙就是曾经埋葬过星光体的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.96哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是你不是和96联手了吗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，没错。但是啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}96和Astral同归于尽之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙留下的力量就由我收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以现在这家伙就是我的傀儡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们迟早也会被我吞噬，变成这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖下一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.39,0:07:45.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗皇家里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一回合都不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不能输给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了纳修也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤暴雪雷鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暴雪幻象！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以变成自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同的一只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过攻击力会变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用两只等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}血鳍蜥·雷蜥蜴叠放，超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.103！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神葬零娘 拉格纳·零！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～。这么快就有可爱小妞登场了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。就让你们见识见识，我们两人的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤神圣·雷光之翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多鲁贝）这张怪兽召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将一只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神圣·雷光怪兽特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧神圣·雷光拳击手！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}书籍 1回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将手牌的魔法卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌将1只神圣·闪电怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.81,0:09:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 神圣·闪电剑！
